{"channelId":"UC-UB99rP8j61NPT78T68jOw","row":["Happy Paws Adoption",33600,"Happy Paws Adoption is a channel dedicated to the love, rescue, and happiness of dogs around the world. 🐶❤️\n\nHere you’ll find heartwarming dog rescue stories, adorable puppy moments, funny dog videos, and inspiring adoption journeys that show how amazing our four-legged friends truly are.\n\nOur mission is simple — to spread kindness, encourage dog adoption, and share the joy that dogs bring into our lives. Every rescued dog deserves a second chance, a safe home, and a loving family.\n\nFrom emotional rescue stories to hilarious dog moments that will make you smile, Happy Paws Adoption celebrates the beautiful bond between humans and dogs.\n\nWhether you love cute puppies, rescue transformations, or funny dog behavior — this channel is for every dog lover.\n\n🎬 Videos on this channel may include storytelling and AI-assisted visuals created for awareness, inspiration, and entertainment.\n\n💛 If you love dogs, rescue stories, and heartwarming animal moments — subscribe and join our community!","","United States"],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC-UB99rP8j61NPT78T68jOw","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC-UB99rP8j61NPT78T68jOw","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:02:40.149Z","channelId":"UC-UB99rP8j61NPT78T68jOw","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"38f843c4b9ee4cd008382b1c6cff5653bbe8b55902b2c17715b02e10aac11108","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"488a17a0e556669d6d0403318f144c0ce0639df7a38f5721e8150a59209a8c18"},"countrySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC-UB99rP8j61NPT78T68jOw","observedAt":"2026-09-18T09:22:16.219Z"},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC-UB99rP8j61NPT78T68jOw","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":33600,"raw":"33.6K subscribers","precision":"rounded","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC-UB99rP8j61NPT78T68jOw","observedAt":"2026-09-18T1